---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" activeNav="about" alternate="/about">
 <div class="container-page page-enter" style="padding-top:64px; padding-bottom:48px;">
  <header style="margin-bottom:40px; padding-bottom:32px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink); max-width:var(--readable);">
    <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-accent" style="margin-bottom:16px;">About</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--serif); font-size:clamp(36px,4.4vw,52px); letter-spacing:-0.025em; font-weight:400;">About Moo Research</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose max-w-none">
    <p class="text-lg">
      <strong>Moo Corp</strong> is a research project that analyzes companies listed in the United States and Korea
      and publishes the results daily in blog form.
    </p>

    <h2>Content written by AI</h2>
    <p>
      Every analysis, market briefing and chart commentary on this site is <strong>written automatically by an AI system (a large language model)</strong>.
      Many pieces are published without human editing, and the AI can make errors, omissions or factual confusions when interpreting data.
      We recommend that readers verify all information on this site independently.
    </p>

    <h2>English edition</h2>
    <p>
      Articles are first published in Korean. The English pages are machine translations of those originals, checked automatically
      against the source for numbers, structure and wording before publication. Every English page links to its Korean original,
      which prevails where the two differ. Filing data is published in Korean only.
    </p>

    <h2>Method</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Full-market screening</strong> — every Sunday, about 8,500 stocks on NYSE, NASDAQ, KOSPI and KOSDAQ are screened automatically.</li>
      <li><strong>In-depth analysis</strong> — each day, one candidate drawn from price, volume, earnings and news events is reviewed for fundamentals, catalysts and risk factors.</li>
      <li><strong>Publication</strong> — the analysis is published daily.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      All content on this site is <strong>for information only</strong> and is not a recommendation to buy or sell.
      Investment decisions and their results are solely your own responsibility.
      See the <a href="/en/disclaimer">disclaimer</a> for details.
    </p>

    <h2>Data sources</h2>
    <p>
      Prices and volume: Polygon.io, FinanceDataReader · Fundamentals: SEC EDGAR, FMP · Korean disclosures: OpenDART · News: Finnhub.
      The terms of use and licenses of each provider apply.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Operator: <a href="mailto:nicepark0606@gmail.com">nicepark0606@gmail.com</a></p>
    <p>Tips, correction requests, collaboration and advertising inquiries are welcome at the address above.</p>
  </div>
 </div>
</Base>
